{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22039","headline":"叹鲁二首 二 · 白居易","name":"叹鲁二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"展禽胡爲者，直道竟三黜。\n颜子何如人，屡空聊过日。\n皆怀王佐道，不践陪臣秩。\n自古无奈何，命爲时所屈。\n有如草木分，天各与其一。\n荔枝非名花，牡丹无甘实。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}